  "contract": [
    "Null pool returns -1. Nonpositive signed size returns -2 before clearing. Positive sizes are cleared before descriptor validation, including positive invalid sizes.",
    "Descriptor accepts unsigned sizes1024..0x40000000 inclusive. It publishes the canonical pool cell, initializes bin anchors, top/end/available words and initial block size encoding in native write order.",
    "Top alignment is(base+51)&~7, not a fixed portable-model offset. Shared control words retain absolute32-bit addresses; no portable heap context is aliased to them."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "All124 native instruction bytes execute in3520 direct comparisons with fill modeled, and560 comparisons with actual fill. Huge fills are modeled requests with only the observed arena materialized; no ownership of a gigabyte allocation is claimed. Real-fill cases are bounded to the mapped pool.",
    "The existing C fill body and relocations equal the normal object. It has a bool return unlike the native void leaf; both initializer callers discard that result. SRAM fill transaction widths are not constrained; descriptor writes match in width/order/value.",
    "288 chains execute actual init hook, reset getter, algorithm configuration/memory entries, new native initializer, C fill and register loader. Deinitializer and virtual-register writer remain modeled. Full30016-byte pool contents and shared state match.",
    "The new ABI provider supersedes the old frontier symbol hint. Portable goodix_heap utilities are preserved, with their own different API and behavior; their objects are unchanged. Only one native initialization provider is selected.",
    "Only4-byte-aligned pool addresses are tested. Caller scratch, private frames, APSR, out-of-arena clearing, physical memory faults, concurrent interrupts, allocation/release/exhaustion policy, physical sensor behavior, final startup/scatter integration, full application linking and boot remain unverified.",
    "No new pool buffer: the existing algorithm pool is reused. One4-byte canonical active-pool cell and one C unit are added. The goodix_mem_init import is removed without new imports."
  ],
